---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section id="picks">
  <div class="wide-container">
    <div class="section-label">Live output</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Sports picks</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">
      This page checks for new public picks every minute and after a manual refresh. A feed changes only after the matching free-channel Discord post succeeds. It shows selections, markets, bot-reported scores, and available odds; bankrolls, stakes, private-channel picks, and performance claims are not published.
    </p>
    <div class="scoreboard-toolbar">
      <button id="sports-picks-refresh" class="refresh-button" type="button">Check for new picks</button>
      <p id="sports-picks-status" class="scoreboard-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading the latest published pick feed…</p>
    </div>
    <div id="sports-picks-feed" class="sports-feed" aria-live="polite">
      <p class="feed-empty">No pick output has been published yet.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="data-caveat">Picks are experimental model outputs, not guarantees or independently verified probabilities. Published time is shown so older slates are not mistaken for current recommendations.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script is:inline src={`${base}js/sports-picks.js`} defer></script>
